  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roger Berman Runs Marathon for Marginalized Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roger Berman is the founder of Japan-based ZenWorks, a brand licensing consultancy and agency and is an active supporter of Mirai no Mori. This year, Roger will be running the Chester Metric Marathon in the U.K on October 2nd 2022 to raise funds in support of marginalized youth attending Mirai no Mori&apos;s winter programs. At Mirai no Mori, children gain confidence in themselves through participation in outdoor adventures with mentors and peers who become life-long friends.</narrative>
  </description>
